; How accounts link to budgets: through the `budget` entries of the account's `open` in effect at a posting's date
; and time. An account in two budgets counts in both; a repeated entry counts once; several accounts add up in one
; budget; a posting to an Income, Liabilities or Equity account counts negated; a sub-account does not count in its
; parent's budget; an account closed and opened again with other budgets counts in those from the reopening on, also
; when it reopens later the same day; and a second `open` without a close.
option "operating_currency" "CNY"
option "timezone" "UTC"

1970-01-01 commodity CNY

2024-01-01 open Assets:Bank
2024-01-01 open Assets:Wallet
  budget: Pocket
2024-01-01 open Liabilities:Card
  budget: Food
2024-01-01 open Income:Refunds
  budget: Food
2024-01-01 open Equity:Adjust
  budget: Food
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Food
  budget: Food
  budget: Health
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Food:Snacks
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Pharmacy
  budget: Health
  budget: Health
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Gym
  budget: Health

2024-01-01 budget Food CNY
2024-01-01 budget Health CNY
2024-01-01 budget Pocket CNY
2024-01-01 budget Leisure CNY
2024-01-01 budget-add Food 1000 CNY
2024-01-01 budget-add Health 300 CNY

2024-01-05 * "Market" "an account in Food and in Health"
  Expenses:Food 100 CNY
  Assets:Bank

2024-01-06 * "Kiosk" "a sub-account linked to no budget"
  Expenses:Food:Snacks 7 CNY
  Assets:Bank

2024-01-07 * "Pharmacy" "a repeated budget entry"
  Expenses:Pharmacy 20 CNY
  Assets:Bank

2024-01-08 * "Gym" "paid by a card linked to Food"
  Expenses:Gym 50 CNY
  Liabilities:Card

2024-01-09 * "Shop" "a refund booked to an Income account linked to Food"
  Assets:Bank 15 CNY
  Income:Refunds

2024-01-10 * "Bank" "an Equity adjustment linked to Food"
  Assets:Bank 3 CNY
  Equity:Adjust

2024-01-11 * "ATM" "cash into an Assets account linked to Pocket"
  Assets:Wallet 40 CNY
  Assets:Bank

2024-01-25 * "Bank" "paying the card"
  Liabilities:Card 50 CNY
  Assets:Bank

; reopened on another day with another budget
2024-01-31 close Expenses:Pharmacy
2024-02-01 open Expenses:Pharmacy
  budget: Leisure

2024-02-02 * "Pharmacy" "after the reopening"
  Expenses:Pharmacy 9 CNY
  Assets:Bank

; reopened later the same day with another budget
2024-02-10 08:00:00 * "Gym" "before the reopening of the day"
  Expenses:Gym 11 CNY
  Assets:Bank

2024-02-10 09:00:00 close Expenses:Gym
2024-02-10 10:00:00 open Expenses:Gym
  budget: Leisure

2024-02-10 11:00:00 * "Gym" "after the reopening of the day"
  Expenses:Gym 13 CNY
  Assets:Bank

; opened again without a close
2024-03-01 open Expenses:Food
  budget: Leisure

2024-03-02 * "Market" "after a second open without a close"
  Expenses:Food 5 CNY
  Assets:Bank
